    "font" : "Helvetica",
    "font size" : 9.0,
    "text color" : "[0.0, 0.0, 0.0]",
    "content" : "A stable internal environment in terms of strategic direction of the outsourcing bank influences ITO success. Firstly, environmental changes can obviate desire for ITO in general. A change in strategic direction against ITO can be caused by a new internal management too. Secondly, environmental stability stable IT requirements for the lifetime of the ITO contract and thus avoids costly contractual amendments if possible at all."
